---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import RokaMixer from '../components/RokaMixer';

---

<Layout
  title="Stand Out Rokakaka Guide – Resetting Stands & 33 Roka Mutations | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Complete guide to Rokakaka Fruit and mutations in Roblox STAND OUT. Learn how to reset Stands with Emerald Roka and explore all 33 verified mutations with our mixer tool."
  canonicalPath="rokakaka"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Rokakaka & Mutations' }]}
  schemaType="CollectionPage"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-100 text-teal-800 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-teal-200">
        <span>Botanical Equivalent Exchange</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>33 Verified Mutations</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Stand Out Rokakaka &amp; Mutations Guide
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        The Rokakaka fruit is the bedrock of customization in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong>. Consumed for Stand resets, sub-ability cleanses, or tactical buffs, each fruit adheres to the law of Equivalent Exchange by petrifying a body part to stone.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Roka Mixer Component -->
    <div class="mb-14 scroll-mt-24" id="mixer">
      <RokaMixer client:load />
    </div>

    <!-- Essential Reset Guide -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">How to Reset Stands Safely</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 mb-2">Emerald Rokakaka (Stand Reset)</h3>
          <p class="mb-2">
            Eating an <strong>Emerald Roka</strong> strips your active Stand, allowing you to use fresh arrows.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-slate-800">
            <li><strong>Normal Grade:</strong> 60% Stand removal success chance</li>
            <li><strong>Good Grade:</strong> 85% Stand removal success chance</li>
            <li><strong>Perfect Grade:</strong> 100% Guaranteed removal without penalty</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 mb-2">Sapphire Rokakaka (Sub-Ability Reset)</h3>
          <p class="mb-2">
            Eating a <strong>Sapphire Roka</strong> offers a 50% chance to remove your Hamon or Vampire style.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-slate-800">
            <li>Grants +10% of your current level EXP bar even if removal fails</li>
            <li>Cannot be brewed into splash throwable potions</li>
            <li>Keeps your Stand completely safe</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-emerald-950 mb-2">Opal Rokakaka (Stand Evolution Catalyst)</h3>
          <p class="mb-2 text-emerald-900">
            The mythical mutation required to awaken <strong>Star Platinum: The World (SPTW)</strong> and <strong>The World: Alternative Universe (TWAU)</strong> for endgame progression.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-emerald-900 mb-3">
            <li>Triggers Stand awakening cutscene and moveset transformation</li>
            <li>Obtained via greenhouse cross-fertilization or endgame raids</li>
            <li>Requires character level 50+ before consumption</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/items/opal-rokakaka/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800">
            Read Opal Rokakaka Obtainment &amp; Evolution Guide &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-purple-50/70 border border-purple-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-purple-950 mb-2">Pure Rokakaka (Skill Point Reset)</h3>
          <p class="mb-2 text-purple-900">
            Resets all allocated character and Stand skill points (up to 225 SP at Level 75) without wiping your current Stand ability.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-purple-900 mb-3">
            <li>Refunds all points back to your character pool</li>
            <li>Essential when re-specifying stats between PvP and PvE builds</li>
            <li>Preserves all unlocked Stand awakening stages</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/guides/level-up-fast/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 hover:text-purple-800">
            View Optimal Leveling &amp; Stat Builds &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
